test/
├── layer1-calibrate/        - Layer 1 light ring calibration build
├── layer1-serial-debug/     - Layer 1 serial packet debug build
├── layer2-cam-debug/        - Layer 2 camera serial/debug build
├── layer2-dribbler-debug/   - Layer 2 dribbler ESC debug build
├── layer2-goalie-debug/     - Layer 2 goalie behaviour debug build
├── layer2-imu-debug/        - Layer 2 IMU debug build
├── layer2-ir-debug/         - Layer 2 IR ball data debug build
├── layer2-loc-center/       - Layer 2 localisation/return-to-centre debug build
├── layer2-motor-debug/      - Layer 2 motor direction/speed debug build
├── layer2-scoring-debug/    - Layer 2 kicker, lightgate, and scoring debug build
└── layer2-serial-debug/     - Layer 2 serial links debug build

Debug/test environments for individual subsystems. Each folder maps to a
PlatformIO environment in platformio.ini. Build and upload with:

    pio run -e layer1-serial-debug --target upload

For future PlatformIO native unit tests, add them here as well:

    [env:native]
    platform = native

    test/test_angle_utils/test_angle_utils.cpp

Run tests with: pio test -e native
